OL,3,AEU leaders fail to bridge budget splits
OL,4,Aas talks stall
OL,5,
OL,6,FEuropean Union (EU) leaders have
OL,7,Fdeferred negotiations on its long-term
OL,8,Fbudget after tensions surfaced over the
OL,9,Fbloc's spending priorities and aid for
OL,10,FUkraine.
OL,12,FTense talks on the 2028-34 budget ended
OL,13,Fafter 12 hours on Thursday at a summit
OL,14,Fin Brussels, with some members walking
OL,15,Fout of negotiations that will resume in
OL,16,FDecember.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
