OL,3,AEU leaders fail to bridge budget splits
OL,4,Aas talks stall
OL,5,
OL,6,FDivisions were largely split along the
OL,7,Flines of countries, including France
OL,8,Fand Italy, wanting to approve a
OL,9,Fhigher-spending proposal against those
OL,10,Fadvocating for financial restraint,
OL,11,Fwith Germany chief among them.
OL,13,FMany members want the budget locked in
OL,14,Fahead of several high-stakes elections
OL,15,Fheld across Europe in 2027, including
OL,16,Fin France.
